          "type": "callout",
          "style": "cloud",
          "title": "Key idea",
          "text": "XSS beats every client-side store. Cookies move the token out of JS reach, so the job becomes CSRF — a solved problem. ==BFF is the default==; localStorage is the shortcut you pay for later."
