    {
      "page_title": "Signature, Claim & Trust Failures",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Signature And Secret",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "qa",
          "q": "What is the worst of all these bugs?",
          "a_bullets": [
            "==Signature never verified==: app base64-decodes and trusts the payload",
            "`jwt.decode()` used where `jwt.verify()` was meant",
            "HMAC secret is `secret`, `changeme` or committed to the repo",
            "One secret shared by **staging and production**, so a test token opens prod"
          ],
          "example_code": [
            "const p = jwt.decode(tok)  // BAD",
            "if (p.role === 'admin') ...",
            "jwt.verify(tok, key, opts) // GOOD"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "4. Claim Failures",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "qa",
          "q": "A valid signature — is the token ours?",
          "a_bullets": [
            "No ==aud== check: a token for the billing API replays against the admin API",
            "No ==iss== check: any issuer the code happens to have a key for",
            "`exp` written in {red:milliseconds}, so 1970-scale seconds means ~50,000 years",
            "No `exp` at all, a token that __never dies__ and cannot be aged out"
          ],
          "example_code": [
            "exp: Date.now()      // ms, BAD",
            "exp: Math.floor(Date.now()/1000)",
            "aud: 'api://orders', iss: URL"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "5. Example: Trusted Claims",
          "ink": "orange"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "js",
          "lines": [
            "// client-supplied, NOT authority",
            "tenant = payload.tenant_id",
            "price  = payload.plan_price",
            "// server decides instead:",
            "tenant = db.tenantOf(payload.sub)",
            "price  = plans[db.planOf(sub)]"
          ],
          "note": "scopes, roles, tenant, price: re-check"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "7. Leaky Surfaces",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Debug or `/whoami` endpoints that ==echo the decoded token== back",
            "Error pages printing the raw `Authorization` header into a stack trace",
            "'No such user' vs 'wrong password' — __user enumeration__ for free",
            "Tokens logged by proxies because they were passed in a query string"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Migration: issue __both__ session + token; dual-validate",
            "Window = old session TTL; then drop session reader",
            "Cut over per route, watch 401 rate before deleting store"
          ],
          "style": "number",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "purple"
        }
      ],
