    {
      "page_title": "Flow Failures & Safe Defaults",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "6. Flow Failures",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "qa",
          "q": "Where does the OAuth dance go wrong?",
          "a_bullets": [
            "`redirect_uri` matched by ==wildcard or prefix==, so the code lands on evil.com",
            "No `state` check: {red:CSRF login-fixation}, victim signed into attacker's account",
            "No `nonce` check: an id_token from another session is **injected** and accepted",
            "Auth code replayable, refresh token not rotated, logout that revokes nothing"
          ],
          "example_code": [
            "// prefix match = open redirect",
            "uri.startsWith('https://app.io')",
            "// https://app.io.evil.com/cb  ✗",
            "registered.includes(uri) // exact"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "cloud",
          "title": "The one rule",
          "text": "A token is a **claim**, not a fact. Pin the algorithm, verify the signature, then check `iss` and `aud` — and let the server, never the payload, decide what the holder may do."
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Pin `alg`; separate HMAC and public-key code paths entirely",
            "Exact-match `redirect_uri`; always validate `state` and `nonce`",
            "Single-use codes, rotating refresh, reuse detection revokes the family",
            "Secrets 256-bit, per-environment, out of the repo; `exp` in seconds"
          ],
          "style": "checkbox",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Recommended Defaults",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Grant: ==authorization code + PKCE==, exact redirect URI",
            "Sign: **RS256** or **ES256**, keys via `/jwks.json`",
            "Access token `exp` = ==10 min==; refresh ==rotating==",
            "Cookies `HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax`"
          ],
          "style": "checkbox",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Gateway Verifies Once",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "nginx",
          "lines": [
            "# gateway (edge)",
            "verify sig + iss + exp  # once",
            "set X-Auth-Sub  $jwt_sub",
            "set X-Auth-Scope $jwt_scope",
            "strip incoming X-Auth-*  # !"
          ],
          "note": "strip client-sent identity headers"
        }
      ],
      "hero": "iam",
      "subtitle": "Reference Architecture"
