  "caption": {
    "text": "Part 3 of JWT & OAUTH 2.0. 0. Your login works until someone hands it a token you never actually verified. This carousel walks the whole bearer-token stack by hand — JWT anatomy, HS256 vs RS256 vs ES256 and JWKS, the full verification checklist, Authorization Code + PKCE, refresh rotation with reuse detection, revocation in a stateless world, and where the token should actually live in a browser. Ends with a mistake museum of real auth bypasses and a reference architecture you can copy.",
